[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266501130","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118669#issuecomment-4266501130","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118669","id":4266501130,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-TaQK","user":{"login":"shaun0927","id":70629228,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNjI5MjI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70629228?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927","html_url":"https://github.com/shaun0927","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shaun0927/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-17T08:28:45Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T08:28:45Z","body":"Thanks @bruvzg for the review.\n\nPushed a follow-up that addresses both points:\n\n- Moved the guard from `_get_screen_hdr_data` to the four public HDR methods you listed (`window_is_hdr_output_supported`, `window_request_hdr_output`, `window_set_hdr_output_reference_luminance`, `window_set_hdr_output_max_luminance`), so the check sits at the API boundary like the rest of the class.\n- Dropped the `controller.ShutdownQueueAsync().get()` change — your point about the main thread / stopped event pump is right, it would have deadlocked. The per-window token revoke in `destroy_wd` already handles the practical race, so the original concern was moot.\n\nThe deferred callback `_winrt_adv_color_info_cb` still keeps its own guard, since it's the entry point from the WinRT dispatcher back into Godot.\n\nLet me know if there are other call sites I missed.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4266501130/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4287069057","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118669#issuecomment-4287069057","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118669","id":4287069057,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_h3uB","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-21T08:33:24Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T08:33:24Z","body":"Superseded by:\r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118680","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin